title: The Conference
---
show_in_menu: yes
---
body:

PyCascades is a regional PyCon in the Pacific Northwest, celebrating the west coast Python developer and user community. Our organizing team includes members of the Vancouver, Seattle, and Portland Python user groups.

Started in 2018, PyCascades has previously been a two-day, single-track Python conference. We are excited to be returning for our 9th year to Seattle at the University of Washington for March 20-21st, 2027.


